    "lawCode": "Amd §353, Exec L",
    "lawSection": "Executive Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S1852\n\n TITLE OF BILL :  An act to amend the executive law, in relation to\ninformation to be posted to the division of veterans' affairs website\n\n PURPOSE OF BILL :\n\nThe purpose of this bill is ensure that veterans are aware of their\noption to utilize state operated veteran homes.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\n\nSection One amends the executive law, to require the Division to\nupdate the fact sheet that they maintain for veterans, concerning\ntheir health care options, to include information on the state\noperated veteran homes.\n\nSection Two is the effective date.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nThe Division of Veterans Affairs currently maintains a fact sheet\nconcerning veteran health care options, which is provided to veterans\nadmitted to a general hospital in this state. This legislation would\nrequire the Division to update their fact sheet, and include\ninformation pertaining to the state operated veteran homes.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nNone to the state.\n\n PRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\nNew Bill.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect on the ninetieth day after it shall become\nlaw.\n",
